000100*================================================================
000200* RDMTR  MOTOR RISK DETAIL
000300*        THE 60-BYTE POL-RISK-DETAIL OF POLREC FOR LINE MTR.
000400*        USED BY RATMTR01.
000500*        policy-admin FILLS THE SAME 60 BYTES IN PRMCOMM
000600*        REQ-RISK-DETAIL WHEN IT CALLS PRMCALC0.
000700*
000800*  VEH-GROUP       VEHICLE GROUP 01-50, REFER ABOVE 3X THRESHOLD
000900*  DRIVER-AGE      YOUNGEST NAMED DRIVER, YEARS
001000*  NCD-YEARS       NO-CLAIMS DISCOUNT YEARS, CAPPED AT 9
001100*  ANNUAL-MILES    DECLARED ANNUAL MILEAGE
001200*  GARAGED         Y = KEPT IN A LOCKED GARAGE OVERNIGHT
001300*  USE-CLASS       S SOCIAL, C COMMUTING, B BUSINESS
001400*================================================================
001500 01  WS-MTR-DETAIL.
001600     05  WS-VEH-GROUP             PIC 9(02).
001700     05  WS-DRIVER-AGE            PIC 9(02).
001800     05  WS-NCD-YEARS             PIC 9(02).
001900     05  WS-ANNUAL-MILES          PIC 9(06).
002000     05  WS-GARAGED               PIC X(01).
002100     05  WS-USE-CLASS             PIC X(01).
002200     05  FILLER                  PIC X(46).
